    "chunk_text": "he f\u00e6ringa on Ac he w\u00e6s mid godcunde egesan swi\u00f0e ge\u00feread, & he \u00fea him \u00feone eadigan wer, sancte Martine, Swylce w\u00e6s eft eac o\u00f0er wundor \u00feyssum onlic, & \u00fe\u00e6t gelamp sume si\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6r he sum deofulgild br\u00e6c \u00dea br\u00e6gd \u00feara h\u00e6\u00f0enra manna sum his seax. \u00dea se h\u00e6\u00f0ena man hine stingan wolde, \u00fea nyste he f\u00e6ringa hw\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t seax cwom \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6r on handa Gelomlice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r he \u00f0a idlan gild br\u00e6c & him \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan men wi\u00feerwearde w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6t & he to \u00fe\u00e6s mihtig w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6lce untrumnesse to h\u00e6lanne, & to \u00fe\u00e6s mycle gife he \u00f0\u00e6s \u00e6t Gode Ge \u00fe\u00e6t oft gelamp \u00feonne hwylc man his hr\u00e6gles d\u00e6l to untrumum menn brohte \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feonne \u00feurh In \u00feyssum he \u00feonne w\u00e6s ealles swi\u00f0ost to herigenne, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6fre n\u00e6nigum woruldricum men ne Ac hie a in eallum so\u00f0 & riht don wolde. \u00deis is so\u00f0lice eadig wer, ne w\u00e6s n\u00e6fre facen ne inwit in his heortan, ne \u00e6nigne unrihtlice demde nene Ne hine \u00e6nig man yrre ne gramheortne ne geseah, ac he w\u00e6s in anum mode, & efne heofonlice blisse & ne gehyrde \u00e6nig man aht elles of his mu\u00f0e butan Cristes lof & nytte spr\u00e6ce, ne aht elles on his Swylce eac \u00fees eadiga wer, sanctus Martinus, mycle \u00e6r beforan",
